{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Normalize sampling into the documented half-open interval**\n\nDividing by `0xffffffff` maps the maximum unsigned hash to exactly `1.0`, contradicting the documented `[0,1)` range and shifting deterministic sampling boundaries. Divide by `2^32` (`0x1_0000_0000L`) and add shared fixed-vector tests, coordinating the boundary change with the other SDK implementations.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7obKDG","finding_digest":"e7d59d7f97adf9275b8c6059f365d1f81f01b4bd532c18412ba85b880824af36","finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","line":430,"observation_digest":"83134fbd873f423961882b9541ab5cbd0fe624a72eb14803747e2e3af7ec411a","observation_id":"aro_v1_qmju7pmhh5bdsymifokudk24xu","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","published_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:14Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tayk6qge2h3e74wst5kjjjd6wi","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"24e28b812198c4b065174ba4b7f7600305deb4ae","reviewer":"codex","start_line":430,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_cdxchjmwvzj2ozaee552zgnbgx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-31T23:44:14Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
